Package: tribios-vfs
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, fuse3, git
Description: virtual filesystem for parallel agent workspaces
 Tribios VFS gives many isolated development workspaces a shared, immutable
 Base state and a private copy-on-write upper tree, so creating, mutating and
 destroying a workspace costs roughly what the workspace itself changed rather
 than what the repository contains.
 .
 This is a preview package from a project-owned repository. The command
 surface, the on-disk metadata format and the mounted filesystem semantics are
 the documented compatibility surface, and Tribios is still at 0.y.z, so a
 minor version may break any of them.
